# Normalize line endings for the Chrome extension sources so the dev build (this
# repo) and the packaged release build produce byte-identical files and stop
# showing spurious CRLF/LF churn in diffs. Scoped to tools/chrome-extension/.
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf
